{"step_index":2472,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T16:14:43Z","thinking":"**Examining Initialization**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `WebDatabase.init()` function and how it uses `dexieDb.initialize()`. I've determined that `WebDatabase.init()` ensures initialization only happens once, preventing redundant calls. My analysis now zeroes in on the exact behavior of `dexieDb.initialize()` within that context. I'm checking for race conditions.\n\n\n**Analyzing Data Loading**\n\nI've shifted my attention to how data loads after initialization. I've noticed the application attempts to load data from Dexie tables in parallel, handling potential errors and falling back to legacy storage if needed. The `WebDatabase.init()` function populates several internal properties with the loaded data, and now I'm inspecting how that impacts subsequent operations. I'm also examining the `saveToStorage()` function for its transaction structure.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Connect WebDatabase to Dexie.js in database.ts","EndLine":60,"Instruction":"Initialize and sync WebDatabase with Dexie.js","ReplacementContent":"import { Platform } from 'react-native';\nimport { IndexedDbStorage, DatabaseState } from './indexedDbStorage';\nimport { dexieDb } from './dexieDb';\n\nexport interface IDatabase {\n  execAsync(sql: string): Promise<void>;\n  getAllAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T[]>;\n  getFirstAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T | null>;\n  runAsync(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<any>;\n  withTransactionAsync(fn: () => Promise<void>): Promise<void>;\n}\n\n// Multi-Gigabyte High-Capacity Web Database Implementation (Dexie.js + IndexedDB)\nclass WebDatabase implements IDatabase {\n  private lists: any[] = [];\n  private leads: any[] = [];\n  private call_logs: any[] = [];\n  private cadence_rules: any[] = [];\n  private sms_templates: any[] = [];\n  private settings: { key: string; value: string }[] = [];\n  private isInitialized: boolean = false;\n\n  constructor() {}\n\n  async init(): Promise<void> {\n    if (this.isInitialized) return;\n    try {\n      await dexieDb.initialize();\n      const [leads, lists, logs, settings, rules, templates] = await Promise.all([\n        dexieDb.leads.toArray(),\n        dexieDb.lists.toArray(),\n        dexieDb.call_logs.toArray(),\n        dexieDb.settings.toArray(),\n        dexieDb.cadence_rules.toArray(),\n        dexieDb.sms_templates.toArray(),\n      ]);\n\n      this.leads = leads;\n      this.lists = lists;\n      this.call_logs = logs;\n      this.settings = settings;\n      this.cadence_rules = rules;\n      this.sms_templates = templates;\n      this.isInitialized = true;\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('WebDatabase Dexie init error, fallback to legacy snapshot:', e);\n      const state = await IndexedDbStorage.loadState();\n      this.lists = state.lists;\n      this.leads = state.leads;\n      this.call_logs = state.call_logs;\n      this.cadence_rules = state.cadence_rules;\n      this.sms_templates = state.sms_templates;\n      this.settings = state.settings;\n      this.isInitialized = true;\n    }\n  }\n\n  private async saveToStorage(): Promise<void> {\n    try {\n      await dexieDb.transaction(\n        'rw',\n        [dexieDb.leads, dexieDb.lists, dexieDb.call_logs, dexieDb.settings, dexieDb.sms_templates, dexieDb.cadence_rules],\n        async () => {\n          await dexieDb.leads.clear();\n          await dexieDb.leads.bulkPut(this.leads);\n          await dexieDb.lists.clear();\n          await dexieDb.lists.bulkPut(this.lists);\n          await dexieDb.call_logs.clear();\n          await dexieDb.call_logs.bulkPut(this.call_logs);\n          await dexieDb.settings.clear();\n          await dexieDb.settings.bulkPut(this.settings);\n          await dexieDb.sms_templates.clear();\n          await dexieDb.sms_templates.bulkPut(this.sms_templates);\n          await dexieDb.cadence_rules.clear();\n          await dexieDb.cadence_rules.bulkPut(this.cadence_rules);\n        }\n      );\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('Dexie saveToStorage error:', e);\n    }\n\n    // Keep redundant safety snapshot\n    const state: DatabaseState = {\n      lists: this.lists,\n      leads: this.leads,\n      call_logs: this.call_logs,\n      cadence_rules: this.cadence_rules,\n      sms_templates: this.sms_templates,\n      settings: this.settings,\n    };\n    IndexedDbStorage.saveState(state).catch(() => {});\n  }","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"import { Platform } from 'react-native';\nimport { IndexedDbStorage, DatabaseState } from './indexedDbStorage';\n\nexport interface IDatabase {\n  execAsync(sql: string): Promise<void>;\n  getAllAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T[]>;\n  getFirstAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T | null>;\n  runAsync(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<any>;\n  withTransactionAsync(fn: () => Promise<void>): Promise<void>;\n}\n\n// Multi-Gigabyte High-Capacity Web Database Implementation (IndexedDB + fallback)\nclass WebDatabase implements IDatabase {\n  private lists: any[] = [];\n  private leads: any[] = [];\n  private call_logs: any[] = [];\n  private cadence_rules: any[] = [];\n  private sms_templates: any[] = [];\n  private settings: { key: string; value: string }[] = [];\n  private isInitialized: boolean = false;\n\n  constructor() {}\n\n  async init(): Promise<void> {\n    if (this.isInitialized) return;\n    try {\n      const state = await IndexedDbStorage.loadState();\n      this.lists = state.lists;\n      this.leads = state.leads;\n      this.call_logs = state.call_logs;\n      this.cadence_rules = state.cadence_rules;\n      this.sms_templates = state.sms_templates;\n      this.settings = state.settings;\n      this.isInitialized = true;\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('WebDatabase init error:', e);\n      this.isInitialized = true;\n    }\n  }\n\n  private async saveToStorage(): Promise<void> {\n    const state: DatabaseState = {\n      lists: this.lists,\n      leads: this.leads,\n      call_logs: this.call_logs,\n      cadence_rules: this.cadence_rules,\n      sms_templates: this.sms_templates,\n      settings: this.settings,\n    };\n    await IndexedDbStorage.saveState(state);\n  }","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\src\\db\\database.ts","toolAction":"Connecting WebDatabase to Dexie.js in database.ts","toolSummary":"Connect WebDatabase to Dexie.js"}}]}
